OL,3,CTeenagers arrested after deliberate
OL,4,Cfire set near Treherbert railway
OL,5,Cstation
OL,7,FThree teenagers have been arrested
OL,8,Ffollowing a deliberate fire that was
OL,9,Fset at the rear of Treherbert railway
OL,10,Fstation on Sunday 16 August.
OL,12,FTwo 15-year-olds and one 13-year-old
OL,13,Fhave been arrested and released under
OL,14,Finvestigation.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
