OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786985592
OL,3,CTeenagers arrested after deliberate
OL,4,Cfire set near Treherbert railway
OL,5,Cstation
OL,7,FIn a statement following the arrests,
OL,8,FSouth Wales Police said: ''These
OL,9,Fincidents put communities at risk, can
OL,10,Fimpact people's health, threaten
OL,11,Fwildlife, and divert emergency
OL,12,Fresources away from people who need
OL,13,Fus.''
OL,15,FPolice say the investigation into the
OL,16,Ffire is currently ongoing.
OL,18,FPrior to the arrests, emergency
OL,19,Fservices were tackling a large
OL,20,Fwildfire in Treherbert, that took hold
OL,21,Fon Saturday 15 August.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
